                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fccb7871-3395-34d5-85dc-0ef5724f24aa",
                        "entry_id": "bd38c129-da5a-3106-8953-f914d157e09c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To change the appearance, layout, or furnishings of."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1e7d42d2-d3c3-44c0-9339-cfbd6fb66de4",
                                "sense_id": "fccb7871-3395-34d5-85dc-0ef5724f24aa",
                                "text": "Modern engine sheds of advanced design have also been built at Radyr, Abercynon, and elsewhere, whilst other depots have been remodelled and re-equipped."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "54268e24-7d5e-4f39-964d-2f5529396996",
                                "sense_id": "fccb7871-3395-34d5-85dc-0ef5724f24aa",
                                "text": "Orificial atherosclerotic lesions are much less likely to respond to balloon dilation alone because they are essentially composed of aortic plaque, which cannot be effectively cracked and remodeled in a durable manner by a balloon alone."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0240cd6d-14a2-4bc4-9d11-5005b8f6d754",
                                "sense_id": "fccb7871-3395-34d5-85dc-0ef5724f24aa",
                                "text": "PC remodeling takes place through deacylation and reacylation processes that is defined as the Lands cycle [12 ]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a98ed585-0415-438e-87f4-bb19c8a5f070",
                                "sense_id": "fccb7871-3395-34d5-85dc-0ef5724f24aa",
                                "text": "The bad news is that few of NR's suggested answers can be delivered quickly. Many involve laying new tracks or remodelling junctions, while there's a suggestion that Oxford Road station itself needs to be rebuilt."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ee530d64-2426-42a7-8dbd-c338d5b22852",
                        "source_entry_id": "bd38c129-da5a-3106-8953-f914d157e09c",
                        "source_sense_id": "fccb7871-3395-34d5-85dc-0ef5724f24aa",
                        "source_sense_description": "to change appearance of",
                        "target_lang_word": "remodeler",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "remodeler",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "afbe36a1-8c07-387b-bddc-d77a16607ec1",
                                        "entry_id": "54f41afe-4c2c-3462-98f2-04bd255a8390",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Modeler à nouveau."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d504b4ca-2daf-4242-9d09-400fe64f2da0",
                                                "sense_id": "afbe36a1-8c07-387b-bddc-d77a16607ec1",
                                                "text": "En deux semaines, le jeune homme a fait le tour de la question et propose à son maître de stage, David Queinnec, un schéma pour une refonte totale de cet outil communal : « Avec les langages appris en licence, sur une base graphique libre de droits que j’ai remodelée pour coller à la charte de Commana, j’ai conçu un nouveau site en encodant tout le contenu et en créant une interface de gestion »."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6af73c6-1a87-44fc-baed-f1e734c36b77",
                                                "sense_id": "afbe36a1-8c07-387b-bddc-d77a16607ec1",
                                                "text": "Et il est parti pour affluer à mesure que le jeu se télégénise, que les règles se remodèlent et que ses stars jouent le jeu de l'image, donc du commerce."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f5817e1-e501-3330-9681-d99868080297",
                                        "entry_id": "54f41afe-4c2c-3462-98f2-04bd255a8390",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Modifier un véhicule de façon plus prononcée que lors d’un restylage, mais sans apporter de transformations profondes à sa ligne générale."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b66f7ce3-e914-4326-b8b1-2bc2f428b6a0",
                        "source_entry_id": "bd38c129-da5a-3106-8953-f914d157e09c",
                        "source_sense_id": "fccb7871-3395-34d5-85dc-0ef5724f24aa",
